# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key.
#
# Google Cloud Console APIs that must be ENABLED on the project this key belongs to:
#   - Maps JavaScript API        (map, drawing, geometry)
#   - Places API (New)           (address/postcode autocomplete search)
#   - Street View Static API is NOT needed; Street View panoramas come with the
#     Maps JavaScript API (Phase 2).
#   - Map Tiles API              (Phase 3 — photorealistic 3D tiles; can enable later)
#
# Recommended key restrictions: HTTP referrer restriction to http://localhost:3000/*
# while developing.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-api-key-here